--- !u!114 &342699559898032609
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 6141992389135737836}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Captain Clamshell
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b14c20d4928f3443d99224b8e9916b9b, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 397528b6828dd4d03bd108ad55a300de, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Clamshell
    sets: met:Clamshell
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Harr! A landlubber on my shore! Captain Clamshell, retired, of the good ship Pinch. Welcome to Puddlebrook.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why is the lake so murky?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The Grey Gloom stirred it up three hundred years ago, and the merfolk sank away to get out of the muck. Nothing but crabs and jellies about now.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: But there's still fish, if you've the patience. Come, I'll teach you. Press the button at a fishing spot, wait for the bobber to dip, then PRESS AGAIN before he gets away. Not too early, mind!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Catch three fish, {hero}, and I'll give you a proper rod.
  - requires: fish_caught>=3
    notIf: thanked:clamshell
    sets: thanked:clamshell
    giveGold: 20
    giveItem: fishing_rod
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Three fish! Shipshape! You've the hands of a born angler.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Here: my old rod, and twenty coins for the bait. With it you get a bit longer to react, and the big fish like it better.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Keep an eye out for the Golden Carp. Legend says one lives in the lake. Never caught him myself. Harr!
  - requires: cleared:Lake4
    notIf: clamshell:cheered
    sets: clamshell:cheered
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: The whole lake just sighed! King Crabbington's himself again. He's my old first mate, you know. Gets crabby when the Gloom's about.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'And you''ve the Bubble Charm! Wear it and you can swim, {hero}: out over the deep water, where the heavy things hide. There''s islands in this lake no boat ever reached.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'The old castle pond, the cove, and the sea: there''s treasure where only swimmers go.'
  - requires: 
    notIf: fish_caught>=3
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Three fish, {hero}. Cast, wait for the bobber to dip, then press again. Patience is half of fishing, and the other half is fish.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Why don't crabs share their toys?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Because they're SHELL-fish! Harr harr harr!
  - requires: found:goldencarp
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: You caught the GOLDEN CARP?! In all my years! Take a bow, {hero}. Take two.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: That anchor on the beach? Mine. Lost it in '94. It's still a good anchor. Just not a good boat.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    takeItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: A crab can only walk sideways, you know. Doesn't matter. I get where I'm going eventually.
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 1104443384206948268}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: -1304493026, guid: 43c203371ba5f4ac1b5d30a45fb2bcd6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 65479398, guid: 43c203371ba5f4ac1b5d30a45fb2bcd6, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: -1740211786, guid: 43c203371ba5f4ac1b5d30a45fb2bcd6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1480320085, guid: 43c203371ba5f4ac1b5d30a45fb2bcd6, type: 3}
  idleFps: 2
  talkFps: 6
